{"seq":2,"slug":"occlusion-culling","title":"遮挡剔除：消除被遮挡的无效渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling/occlusion-culling","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"遮挡剔除-消除被遮挡的无效渲染\">遮挡剔除：消除被遮挡的无效渲染</h1><p>视锥剔除只解决了视野之外的对象。对于复杂场景——密集的城市街道、地下城关卡、多层建筑内部——大量位于视锥内的对象实际上被其他几何体完全遮挡，仍会白白消耗 GPU 资源。<strong>遮挡剔除（Occlusion Culling）</strong> 的任务是识别并丢弃这些被遮挡的对象，让 GPU 只渲染真正可见的几何体。</p>\n<p>遮挡剔除技术从 1990 年代的软件实现发展到今天的 GPU-Driven 方案，演化路径清晰，每个阶段都反映了当时硬件能力的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HZB（Hierarchical Z-Buffer）</strong>：深度图的 mipmap 金字塔，每层存 2×2 区域的最大深度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 单次采样完成遮挡测试</li>\n<li><strong>软件遮挡光栅化</strong>：CPU 侧低分辨率深度图，避免 GPU-CPU 同步延迟，适合少量大型遮挡物</li>\n<li><strong>GPU-Driven Indirect</strong>：Compute Shader 并行测试所有对象 + IndirectBuffer，完全 GPU 端，避免 CPU 瓶颈</li>\n<li><strong>Portal + Room 系统</strong>：预计算可见性，室内场景最高效（预处理代价高），运行时代价极低</li>\n<li><strong>双帧 HZB</strong>：使用上一帧 HZB 预测本帧可见性，引入 1 帧延迟但无 GPU-CPU 同步等待</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"遮挡剔除的基本原理\">遮挡剔除的基本原理</h2><p>一个对象被遮挡，意味着：从摄像机出发，指向该对象的所有光线都在到达该对象之前与其他几何体相交。</p>\n<p>实际中，对象通常用其<strong>包围体</strong>（AABB 或包围球）来测试遮挡：如果包围体完全被遮挡，则对象本身必然也被遮挡（保守估计，可能漏判）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;摄像机&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;遮挡物\\n(大型建筑)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;被遮挡对象\\n(建筑后方的内容)&quot;]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|&quot;光线被建筑遮挡&quot;| C\">graph LR\n    A[\"摄像机\"] --&gt; B[\"遮挡物\\n(大型建筑)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"被遮挡对象\\n(建筑后方的内容)\"]\n    A -.-&gt;|\"光线被建筑遮挡\"| C</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"层次-z-buffer-hzb\">层次 Z-Buffer（HZB）</h2><p><strong>Hierarchical Z-Buffer（HZB）</strong> 是目前最主流的 GPU 遮挡剔除方法，Unreal Engine、Unity HDRP、Red Dead Redemption 2 均使用这一技术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"构建-hzb\">构建 HZB</h3><p>HZB 是场景深度图的 mipmap 金字塔，每一层是下一层的 2x2 最大值降采样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Level 0: 1920×1080 深度图（全分辨率）&#10;Level 1: 960×540   每 2×2 像素块取最大深度&#10;Level 2: 480×270   每 2×2 像素块取最大深度&#10;...&#10;Level k: 1920/2^k × 1080/2^k\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Level 0: 1920×1080 深度图（全分辨率）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Level 1: 960×540   每 2×2 像素块取最大深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Level 2: 480×270   每 2×2 像素块取最大深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Level k: 1920/2^k × 1080/2^k</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键性质</strong>：任意像素在 Level <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的值 = 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k × 2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 像素区域中的<strong>最大深度</strong>（最远深度）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"void buildHZB(const Texture2D&amp; depthBuffer, HZBMipChain&amp; hzb) {&#10;    hzb.levels[0] = depthBuffer;  // 直接复制 Z-buffer&#10;&#10;    for (int level = 1; level &lt; HZB_MAX_LEVELS; level++) {&#10;        int w = hzb.levels[level-1].width  / 2;&#10;        int h = hzb.levels[level-1].height / 2;&#10;        hzb.levels[level] = createTexture(w, h);&#10;&#10;        // 每个像素取对应 4 个像素中的最大深度&#10;        for (int y = 0; y &lt; h; y++) {&#10;            for (int x = 0; x &lt; w; x++) {&#10;                float maxD = std::max({&#10;                    hzb.levels[level-1].sample(2*x,   2*y  ),&#10;                    hzb.levels[level-1].sample(2*x+1, 2*y  ),&#10;                    hzb.levels[level-1].sample(2*x,   2*y+1),&#10;                    hzb.levels[level-1].sample(2*x+1, 2*y+1)&#10;                });&#10;                hzb.levels[level].write(x, y, maxD);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildHZB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Texture2D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> depthBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HZBMipChain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hzb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hzb.levels[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depthBuffer;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 直接复制 Z-buffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HZB_MAX_LEVELS; level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hzb.levels[level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].width  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hzb.levels[level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hzb.levels[level] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createTexture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 每个像素取对应 4 个像素中的最大深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h; y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w; x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxD </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    hzb.levels[level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    hzb.levels[level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E